      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. (本小题满分 15 分)\n已知全集 $U=\\mathbb{R}$，集合 $A=\\{x\\mid x^2-4x-5\\leq 0\\}$，$B=\\{x\\mid 2m\\leq x\\leq 3m+1\\}$。\n(1) 若 $m=2$，求 $(\\complement_U A)\\cap B$；\n(2) 若 $A\\cup B=A$，求实数 $m$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C002"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
