        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.8-max/workflow/page17/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解 (1) $A=\\{x\\mid x^2-4x-5\\leq 0\\}$\n$=\\{x\\mid (x-5)(x+1)\\leq 0\\}$\n$=\\{x\\mid -1\\leq x\\leq 5\\}$\n$\\complement_U A=\\{x\\mid x<-1 \\text{ 或 } x>5\\}$\n$\\because m=2$ $\\therefore B=\\{x\\mid 4\\leq x\\leq 7\\}$\n$\\therefore (\\complement_U A)\\cap B=\\{5<x\\leq 7\\}$\n(2) $\\because A\\cup B=A$ 即 $B\\subseteq A$\n① 若 $B=\\varnothing$ 时，$2m>3m+1$ 即 $m<-1$\n$\\therefore A\\cup B=A$ 成立\n② 若 $B\\neq\\varnothing$ 时，$B=\\{x\\mid 2m\\leq x\\leq 3m+1\\}$\n$\\begin{cases}3m+1\\geq 2m\\\\ -1\\leq 2m\\\\ 5\\geq 3m+1\\end{cases}$ 即 $\\begin{cases}m\\geq -1\\\\ m\\geq -\\frac{1}{2}\\\\ m\\leq \\frac{4}{3}\\end{cases}$ $\\therefore -\\frac{1}{2}\\leq m\\leq \\frac{4}{3}$\n$\\therefore$ 当 $-\\frac{1}{2}\\leq m\\leq \\frac{4}{3}$ 时，$A\\cup B=A$ 成立\n$\\therefore$ $A\\cup B=A$ 时，$m$ 的取值范围为 $\\{m\\mid m<-1 \\text{ 或 } -\\frac{1}{2}\\leq m\\leq \\frac{4}{3}\\}$",
